   "title_original": "Strike drones launched from British aircraft carrier for the first time",
   "summary": "The Royal Navy said Callen-Lenz Nyan Maritime one-way strike drones were launched from HMS Queen Elizabeth's flight deck in the North Atlantic in mid-October 2026, the first such launch from a UK carrier; a Tekever AR5 also operated from the ship during Heavy Lift Challenge 3.",
   "summary_zh": "【未查證】皇家海軍表示，10 月中旬在北大西洋，Callen-Lenz 製 Nyan Maritime 單向攻擊無人機首度從英國航艦伊莉莎白女王號甲板起飛；同艦在 Heavy Lift Challenge 3 中也讓 Tekever AR5 無人機運作。MiGFlug 引述 Navy Lookout 稱 10/20 於 Neptune Reach B 期間發射四架且均抵達目標點，此細節僅單一媒體報導。",
   "why_it_matters_zh": "為「混合艦載機聯隊」概念提供試驗證據，顯示英國探索無人機與 F-35B 協同作戰。",
